# Manual tests (Visual Studio / VS Code REST Client / Rider). Start the API with the "http" profile first:
#   dotnet run --project src/FlixLocadora.Api --launch-profile http
# The CRUD controllers created by CrudGen start [AllowAnonymous]: no token is needed for them yet.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5406

### Health (database included)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Register (default role: Operator)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "dev.user@example.com", "password": "Senha!Forte123" }

### Login → copy data.accessToken
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "dev.user@example.com", "password": "Senha!Forte123" }

### Who am I (Bearer token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
